# PC card pc-melee-crowd (docs/plan-melee-top5.md Stage 3, MMOVE-11..14, BENCH-137): one build alone on today's whole melee field, 46 fields x 6 seeds (3219-3224, after the wide card's 3211-3218), at the machine's melee width (@C@, fixed at prep) and CPU constant. Template: mcprep writes work/melee-crowd-<arm>.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml and @A@ = the arm's suffix (aa, bb, ma, mh, mt, mc); every arm fights the same fields and seeds, so the read pairs them battle for battle.
--suite
melee-census-317.txt
--seeds
6
--seed-base
3218
--rounds
35
--parallel
@C@
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur117.Hadur_@V@@A@.jar
--robot
hadur117.Hadur @V@@A@
--out
work/melee-crowd-@V@-@A@
